abstract: >-
  Research code accompanying the manuscript of the same title. The manuscript
  author list is provided here; module-specific code credits and license scope
  are documented in the READMEs and LICENSES.md. No manuscript DOI or full-repository
  archive DOI was supplied for this release preparation.
